<title>MEXICO: Carso to propose 0.8 pesos/shr dividend.</title>
<headline>Carso to propose 0.8 pesos/shr dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican industrial conglomerate Grupo Carso SA de CV said it would propose to its shareholders a 0.8 pesos per share cash dividend at its annual meeting on April 30.</p>
<p>The information was made available through a statement from the Mexican Stock Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560</p>
</text>
